    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A Cut Above: Mow and Grow</i> is a 3D lawn care business simulator where mowing meets management. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin with a push mower in immersive first-person view.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on contract jobs across stylized low-poly neighborhoods. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut grass, collect clippings, and earn money to invest in better equipment,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage fuel, staff and clients. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate complex pricing systems, business expenses, and upgrade paths. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines satisfying lawn mowing mechanics with light business strategy in a relaxing yet engaging way.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Visuals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Varied Time and Atmosphere in First Person View</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mow through bright days, sunset, and quiet nights. Changing light and environments give each location its own distinct mood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807260/extras/d2077596719ef3b3a64ef51272455831.poster.avif?t=1752360771\" aria-label=\"A rider mower mowing grass at different times of day\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807260/extras/d2077596719ef3b3a64ef51272455831.webm?t=1752360771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807260/extras/d2077596719ef3b3a64ef51272455831.mp4?t=1752360771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Mow in Different Weather Situations</strong></p><p c